After work, I go to a clothing shop.
This shop is in my neighborhood.
This is a very big and nice shop.
There is a lot of light inside the shop.
There is a young salesman there.
I go to him.
I say, "Hello brother!"
He smiles and says, "Hello madam!"
"What do you need?"
I say, "I need some new clothes."
"It is now very hot in Mumbai."
"I want to wear light clothes in this heat."
"Do you have good cotton clothes?"
He says, "Yes madam, we have very good cotton clothes."
"They are very light."
He shows me a big rack.
There are red, blue, and yellow clothes on that rack.
Some clothes are small and some clothes are big.
I start looking at the clothes.
